# Apple ID sessions and downloaded apps must never be committed.
/accounts/
/library/
*.ipa

# Build output.
#
# ANCHORED, and the anchor is load-bearing: a bare `springback` matches at EVERY depth, so it
# also matched `core/cmd/springback/` and silently excluded the package containing main.go. The
# first commit went out without it and built fine, because the Docker build has its own copy of
# the tree — nothing surfaced the omission until a clean checkout was tried.
/springback

# macOS bundle output (deploy/macos/bundle.sh).
/build/
